# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [Unreleased] - 2026-06-08
### Added
- Added POS cash drawer workspace and API integration hooks for drawer opening, movement tracking, expense posting, and shift closure.
- Added receipt template, paper width, and printer mode settings for POS/document printing.
- Added receipt cashier, branch, powered-by, compact, classic, and thermal paper rendering support.

### Changed
- Improved workspace dark-mode theming across Staff, POS, documents, reports, inventory, customer, production, and shared controls.
- Updated POS cart behavior so checkout and hold actions stay accessible on smaller screens.
- Improved floating help positioning so the panel clamps to the visible viewport when opened or resized.

### Fixed
- Fixed Staff Management dark-mode contrast for the page shell, statistics, filters, and table.
- Fixed Create User modal dark-mode backgrounds and field contrast.
- Fixed POS total/price text contrast in dark mode.
- Fixed POS payment, hold, and quick amount button label contrast in disabled and dark-mode states.
- Fixed login button text contrast when the active brand color is green.
- Fixed production login submit button label visibility when brand styling overrides Bootstrap button colors.

### Security
- Hidden administrator, super administrator, and developer accounts from Staff Management lists.
- Added frontend safeguards so protected administrative accounts cannot be deleted from staff controls.
- Excluded environment files, logs, archives, and generated build artifacts from version control.

## [1.1] - 2024-07-22
### Added
- New user authentication system using JWT with codeigniter shield library.

